-- 696.5 (1) If the Commission has reasonable grounds to believe that a miscarriage of justice may have occurred or considers that it is in the interests of justice to do so, it may conduct an investigation in relation to an application.
-- src:19595 | Investigation
-- src:19596 | 696.5 (1) If the Commission has reasonable grounds to believe that a miscarriage of justice may have occurred or considers that it is in the interests of justice to do so, it may conduct an investigation in relation to an application.
@ref s 696.5(1) (not in force) (src:19595-19596)
